  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan inspects Sixth Hair while unconscious and finds a refinement path killer move that seems to spend lifespan to raise refinement path abilities, with red snake tattoos that will kill him when they reach his head.",
      "chapters": [
        1481
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_sixth_hair"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sixth Hair created the move, called refinement snake lifespan flower. It holds refinement path essence and also involves the karma of rule path. An incomplete Gu refinement method from Lang Ya Sect’s treasury inspired it. Fang Yuan judges it is not easy to fix, and carelessness could cost Sixth Hair his life, so he slows the work. As long as Sixth Hair does not use the move again, he will not lose his life.",
      "chapters": [
        1482
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool can utilize this refinement path killer move among others, including slumbering lightning python, wind grind, reflect snow, muffled thunder stone drum, dragon-shaped blizzard, heavenly light ring, and omnipresent four seas.",
